<h2>⚠️ Document Needs Attention</h2>

<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

<p>We've reviewed your submitted document, but unfortunately we need you to resubmit it.</p>

<div class="info-box">
    <p><strong>Business:</strong> {{businessName}}</p>
    <p><strong>Document:</strong> {{documentName}}</p>
    <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span style="color: #ef4444;">✗ Rejected</span></p>
    <p><strong>Reviewed:</strong> {{formatDate reviewedAt}}</p>
</div>

<h3>Reason for Rejection:</h3>
<p
    style="background-color: #fef2f2; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 4px; color: #1d1d1f;">
    {{rejectionReason}}
</p>

<h3>What you need to do:</h3>
<ul style="color: #86868b; line-height: 1.8;">
    <li>Review the feedback above</li>
    <li>Make the necessary corrections</li>
    <li>Upload the updated document</li>
</ul>

<a href="{{actionUrl}}" class="button">Upload New Document</a>

<p>If you have any questions about the feedback, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
    The StartEase Team</p>